cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SocialCompass — Team Communication Analyzer (COIN Archetypes)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A portfolio edition of collaborative coursework on team communication analysis,
  derived from the original SocialCompass implementation. It includes an offline
  fictional-data feature demo, regression fixes, and selected historical aggregate
  results, with individual records excluded and explicit interpretation limits.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kasra-mohebian/team-communication-analyzer"
authors:
